  (set! (values (.-R8 r) (.-R9 r) (.-R10 r) (.-R11 r) (.-R12 r) (.-R13 r) (.-R14 r) (.-R15 r)) (values (aget g 8) (aget g 9) (aget g 10) (aget g 11) (aget g 12) (aget g 13) (aget g 14) (aget g 15))))




(go/type LockstepOpts "LockstepOpts choose the mode: Step from the start, or the sys mode switching to the step mode once StepFrom system calls\nare done (StepFrom < 0: never). MemEvery is the step mode's period of the writable mappings' comparison (0: 4,096).\n" (struct
